{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"meaning_history/senses\",\"value_json\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"八:eight\\\",\\\"gloss\\\":\\\"eight\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"Oracle-bone inscriptions; absolute dates unresolved\\\",\\\"certainty\\\":\\\"established\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"earliest_attested\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Oracle-bone examples use 八 as a cardinal numeral, including in expressions for eight animals and in a month expression. These attest early numeral use, not a hypothetical original meaning.\\\",\\\"evidence_ids\\\":[\\\"ref014\\\",\\\"ref025\\\"]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"八:eighth\\\",\\\"gloss\\\":\\\"eighth; ordinal use\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"Oracle-bone inscriptions and later\\\",\\\"certainty\\\":\\\"established\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"historical\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Oracle-bone month usage and later examples show 八 in month and year expressions with ordinal value. The evidence does not date a distinct development from the cardinal sense.\\\",\\\"evidence_ids\\\":[\\\"ref014\\\",\\\"ref021\\\"]},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"八:separation\\\",\\\"gloss\\\":\\\"separate; divide\\\",\\\"period\\\":\\\"Traditional explanation; earliest attestation unresolved\\\",\\\"certainty\\\":\\\"disputed\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"historical\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"A traditional interpretation reads the diverging strokes as separation. No early written example of 八 with this meaning is provided, so it remains a proposed original sense rather than an established earliest attestation.\\\",\\\"evidence_ids\\\":[\\\"ref002\\\",\\\"ref003\\\",\\\"ref015\\\",\\\"ref019\\\",\\\"ref038\\\"]}]\"}]}"}}
